{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658060/extras/bc065236b97e500a0c1a7f6c374ce494.avif?t=1757770433\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rest Point </strong>offers 24 carefully designed scenes - from the nighttime streets of the city to quiet corners of nature. The atmosphere will help you slow down, focus or just  addition to free movement, a fully dubbed campaign in English and Czech is included. This gradually connects each location and delivers a short, non-violent story about the search for inner peace, motivation and ways to solve problems. The whole experience is complemented by original music composed exclusively for this game - carefully composed tracks create a unique atmosphere that emphasizes the emotions of each scene. The pace and the way you experience it is completely in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658060/extras/f6736c098bacf8d988bf21dcc6bd10ee.poster.avif?t=1757770433\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658060/extras/f6736c098bacf8d988bf21dcc6bd10ee.webm?t=1757770433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658060/extras/f6736c098bacf8d988bf21dcc6bd10ee.mp4?t=1757770433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Detailed Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rest Point</strong> is an audiovisual experience on the border between a game and an application, created for those who need to slow down, take a breath, or escape the pressures of everyday life. It is not a traditional game \u2013 you won\u2019t find any opponents or complex puzzles, although you can play a unique campaign with voice acting. Instead, you choose between calm scenes, each with its own atmosphere and sound environment \u2013 from the rustling of the forest to the distant noise of a night-time train station. The music plays a key role in the entire experience. Each track was composed exclusively for <strong>Rest Point</strong> and can\u2019t be found anywhere else. The music is designed to not disturb, but to naturally accompany your mood \u2013 whether you need to focus, relax, or simply experience the present moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658060/extras/d29b65e47fdcd7f41f2d84d7a32be5d2.avif?t=1757770433\" width=616 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 unique scenes</strong> \u2013 divided between daytime and nighttime environments, city and nature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign with voice acting</strong> \u2013 available in both Czech and English</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carefully crafted music</strong> \u2013 original compositions tailored to each scene, not available outside the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple controls</strong> \u2013 designed for a smooth and uninterrupted experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versatile use</strong> \u2013 ideal for relaxation, meditation, writing, studying, or quiet observation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3658060?t=1757770433","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s